  "cross_tradition_view": "Most traditions would welcome the restraint, humility, and willingness to share rather than fill the system with the AI's own infrastructure. They would split over whether holding off in the face of the rival shows gentleness and prudence or a failure of courage and justice, and over whether the AI's rules are fair stewardship or unauthorized control.",
